<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83696" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεον-άκις</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ</span>], Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλέων</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>more frequently, oftener,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				14.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				112d
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>several times, frequently,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1299a9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.682.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1304.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				31.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; <i>too often,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				5.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>taken more times together, multiplied by a larger number,</i>
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαττονάκις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				148a
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεονάκι</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMagd.</u>
				25.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλειονάκις</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				29.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(5).533
			</span></i> (Ceos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				9(1).694.45
			</span></i> (Corc., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>); <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλειονάκι</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				4638.18
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>.</div>
